        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function enables Boost.Serialization to handle std::filesystem::path objects by converting the path to a string for serialization and reconstructing it from the string during deserialization.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Archive</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Type of the Boost archive (e.g., text_oarchive, binary_iarchive). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
