</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Boost archive used for serialization or deserialization. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>serializablePath</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The path to serialize or deserialize.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>During serialization, the path is converted to a string. During deserialization, the string is read and converted back to a path. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
